{"r":2,"c":[[57,"The device has two operating modes, continuous and triggered, that determine how the ADC operates following"]]}
{"r":3,"c":[[57,"these conversions. When the device is in the normal operating mode (that is, MODE bits of the Configuration"]]}
{"r":4,"c":[[57,"Register (00h) are set to '111'), the device continuously converts a shunt voltage reading followed by a bus"]]}
{"r":5,"c":[[57,"voltage reading. After the shunt voltage reading, the current value is calculated (based on Equation 3). This"]]}
{"r":6,"c":[[57,"current value is then used to calculate the power result (using Equation 4). These values are subsequently"]]}
{"r":7,"c":[[57,"stored in an accumulator, and the measurement/calculation sequence repeats until the number of averages set"]]}
{"r":8,"c":[[57,"in the Configuration Register (00h) is reached. Following every sequence, the present set of values measured"]]}
{"r":9,"c":[[57,"and calculated are appended to previously collected values. After all of the averaging has been completed, the"]]}
{"r":10,"c":[[57,"final values for shunt voltage, bus voltage, current, and power are updated in the corresponding registers that"]]}

{"r":36,"c":[[57,"Calibration Register. If there is no value loaded into the Calibration Register, the current value stored is zero."]]}
{"r":37,"c":[[57,"Power is calculated following the bus voltage measurement based on the previous current calculation and bus"]]}
{"r":38,"c":[[57,"voltage measurement. If there is no value loaded in the Calibration Register, the power value stored is also zero."]]}
{"r":39,"c":[[57,"Again, these calculations are performed in the background and do not add to the overall conversion time. These"]]}
{"r":40,"c":[[57,"current and power values are considered intermediate results (unless the averaging is set to 1) and are stored in"]]}
{"r":41,"c":[[57,"an internal accumulation register, not the corresponding output registers. Following every measured sample, the"]]}
{"r":42,"c":[[57,"newly-calculated values for current and power are appended to this accumulation register until all of the samples"]]}
{"r":43,"c":[[57,"have been measured and averaged based on the number of averages set in the Configuration Register (00h)."]]}
